name: sim.getScript
description: Retrieves the handle of a script. For script objects, use sim.getObject instead
luaSynopsis: int scriptHandle = sim.getScript(int scriptType, string scriptName = '')
pythonSynopsis: int scriptHandle = sim.getScript(int scriptType, string scriptName = '')
inputs:
1. scriptType: type of the script, or sim.handle_self
2. scriptName: name of the add-on, in case of an add-on
outputs:
1. scriptHandle: handle of the script
